and he's got treasure stashed away.{w}I heard he was somewhere around here."{w}{p}"If you spot him, tell me!{w}We'll split the treasure down the middle!"{w}

"Oh dear, oh dear, oh dear...{w}This has turned into a terrible mess..."{w}{p}"Eek!?"{w}{p}"Wh-why, you gave me a fright.{w}Y'see, a friend of mine with some treasure
has been targeted by thieves and is being chased."{w}{p}"If you folks see a greedy-looking thief,
don't tell 'em where my friend is, would ya?"{w}

"Don't lose, Guld!
Get poisoned~ Get poisoned~
Poison-poison~ FLAAAAASH!!"{w}

"This is my secret nest, so when you leave,
search the southwest wall
and find the hidden passage, okay?"{w}{p}"I'm counting on you for that Rolfan~!"{w}

"Who the hell are you?!{w}All the trash around here
belongs to me, the great me!"{w}{p}"If you're that set on digging through the trash,
hand over 1000 GP!!"{w}
